{
 "batchId": "b-0170",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "nl",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_748c5ef297155e398440",
   "sourceHash": "748c5ef297155e3984403f84f009940d0c143b874de7a6ea9217cd8874bd2fcf",
   "text": "Kan ik deelnemen als ik lichamelijke beperkingen of blessures heb?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fa7d7680e7eb33e57352",
   "sourceHash": "fa7d7680e7eb33e57352b78cad0f5a2b768bf6fb72bce33560202e6cd7e0fa12",
   "text": "Onze instructeurs kunnen oefeningen aanpassen aan individuele beperkingen of blessures. Deel vóór deelname de relevante gezondheidsinformatie met ons.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9d2fe270c91696f02d5b",
   "sourceHash": "9d2fe270c91696f02d5bb5e5d7f1e5446aa067073149e984617ba575108a9e72",
   "text": "Welke yogastijlen komen aan bod?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d29e488bbfef33a5583b",
   "sourceHash": "d29e488bbfef33a5583b321ef96aaf4e60c0e2889d063642ed20ae3af895575c",
   "text": "We bieden verschillende yogastijlen aan, waaronder hatha en vinyasa.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cfbe7d40c57c14ca4d89",
   "sourceHash": "cfbe7d40c57c14ca4d89b7740c0ad1c21be2a479a152b2727cf788f50e7fce4c",
   "text": "Wat als ik nog nooit heb gemediteerd?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8675cd6386ca14ae2f0c",
   "sourceHash": "8675cd6386ca14ae2f0c0e5e8731a7f088fb30c119d72ba3d542156329783abc",
   "text": "Onze meditatiesessies zijn geschikt voor beginners. Begeleiders introduceren de technieken die in het programma worden gebruikt.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e535a561c11b079a2480",
   "sourceHash": "e535a561c11b079a248076fb39ed7f21a0a81d7c35ddf72c8b4db2c5b7788ee8",
   "text": "Een patiënt in een groene kurta en een Kairali-yoga-instructeur in het wit staan tegenover elkaar met de handpalmen tegen elkaar in de yogazaal met glazen wanden, met bomen buiten",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Guest' rendered as 'patiënt' (clinical register)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_db35433de9227afb9221",
   "sourceHash": "db35433de9227afb9221e80e8f520749d640e4dfa825865808515b0434d4967f",
   "text": "Patiënt in een groene kurta zit in kleermakerszit op een petrolkleurige mat te mediteren, met gesloten ogen en de handen op haar knieën, in de yogazaal van Kairali",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6acab8c57e509daeef76",
   "sourceHash": "6acab8c57e509daeef7620d41ae6b186f928e094125f6256fb589a92ca0b7433",
   "text": "Patiënt in een groene kurta in een lage halvemaanlunge op een petrolkleurige mat, met één arm geheven, voor de glazen deuren en de witte balustrade van de yogazaal",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_28bb3540aa73e68246f0",
   "sourceHash": "28bb3540aa73e68246f0629414a635cc7f9e4c9c311134cd82a4b871ff16ee81",
   "text": "Patiënt in een groene kurta knielt in een lunge op een petrolkleurige mat, met de armen geheven en de handpalmen boven het hoofd tegen elkaar, omhoogkijkend, in de yogazaal van Kairali",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a0b04904eaab67b659fb",
   "sourceHash": "a0b04904eaab67b659fb21c3312f89eabeef897c5942ec8c48d86bd019221cf5",
   "text": "Winnaar Worlds Luxury Spa Awards 2024",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Award title 'Worlds Luxury Spa Awards' kept verbatim as a proper name.",
    "t_a0b04904eaab67b659fb banned-term-from-source Spa"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_60e1aed948aa76612184",
   "sourceHash": "60e1aed948aa766121842aaa39981ac124622162303fc9b81370dedc084f9e1f",
   "text": "Worlds Luxury Hotel Awards 2024",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Award title (proper name) kept verbatim.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bba6b745144e536d4cc7",
   "sourceHash": "bba6b745144e536d4cc7e542c223227f5a187cc071a8460dc4c2791abcd2f828",
   "text": "K.V. Ramesh, Managing Director van de Kairali Ayurvedic Group, ontving in 2019 de CONSIDICI National Award.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ed07e850107d4debe48e",
   "sourceHash": "ed07e850107d4debe48e7f3d5fad04855bf55a854f2b6fd57f237ac00e2694eb",
   "text": "Yogalessen",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8aec5f233df477e4af53",
   "sourceHash": "8aec5f233df477e4af53c682a679700833b8409df02a976bcfcb556d14505f41",
   "text": ": De sessies omvatten hatha- en vinyasastijlen en worden afgestemd op verschillende ervaringsniveaus.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_78879b429abb9a0fbbf4",
   "sourceHash": "78879b429abb9a0fbbf4bc6fe52c763c2bed6d5c6d847ba5057a73c0193e3d3c",
   "text": "Meditatiesessies",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a9333f127e6eadb620c4",
   "sourceHash": "a9333f127e6eadb620c446168c8dc6fefe5a5e0a852edc3a7c3af19b8d5a854e",
   "text": ": Begeleiders leren u technieken voor mindfulness, ademhalingsbewustzijn en mantrameditatie.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_01e2de292f77a9fca0e3",
   "sourceHash": "01e2de292f77a9fca0e3e78f5d2776878a1b783928d7ac660cd314a63bc55b5b",
   "text": "Ayurvedisch consult",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fe56be42730ac79c6257",
   "sourceHash": "fe56be42730ac79c62576f4f23e78b982431a1ad62b76e17728c40a96129e75b",
   "text": ": Een consult bij een ayurvedische behandelaar om inzicht te krijgen in uw constitutie en doelen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a53e807997872e1cf2dc",
   "sourceHash": "a53e807997872e1cf2dcf5d0b96c30b4fccc98d00769c16d1e2a3492acea7da5",
   "text": "Dagelijkse en seizoensgebonden routines",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_738a0fa7b2e70bc00d07",
   "sourceHash": "738a0fa7b2e70bc00d07870edd25f0dd0a555193d9e94cd9e4a1ff75da74135a",
   "text": ": Deze kunnen ayurvedische voedingsadviezen, dagelijkse routines (dinacharya) en seizoensgebonden gewoonten (ritucharya) omvatten.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_379f0eed8acd93344e68",
   "sourceHash": "379f0eed8acd93344e68a59b971b31f3eaa81cd07e18670efaa3592bda4db475",
   "text": ": Ayurvedische massages, zoals abhyanga en Shirodhara, worden naast de beoefening aangeboden.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_880c95473eeb40219f63",
   "sourceHash": "880c95473eeb40219f6321ddb7c5c48655f66c63119e4a325a21e314920043ef",
   "text": ": Er kunnen vervolgsessies worden gepland om het programma te evalueren.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f49b31c1e01e4fbff928",
   "sourceHash": "f49b31c1e01e4fbff928851f6cf5af976820011f44a39979d0e4f16afdab06fd",
   "text": "Verdiep u in de basisbegrippen van ayurveda. Leer de drie dosha’s en de vijf elementen begrijpen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b8140dff5a6911648c65",
   "sourceHash": "b8140dff5a6911648c6587bfb35d9f4e3485950ec650c6bcfc6b9bd6472e3444",
   "text": "Ontdek de kunst van het ayurvedisch koken met onze ervaren kok. Leer voedzame maaltijden bereiden met traditionele specerijen en kookmethoden.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
